WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.280
I'm careful how I do things.

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:02.860
So careful that you.

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.440
I'm sorry, I forgot what I was gonna say.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:06.720
Come back to me.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.980
Now, we did a sweep of the room where you and Robert fought.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:10.650
Talked.

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:11.580
Right, talked.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.310
The entire room had been scrubbed.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:13.920
It had been cleaned.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:18.660
It had undergone industrial sterilization to remove all traces of blood and DNA.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.140
It's a surgical suite.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.620
People bleed in there every day.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.140
We have to sanitize it by law.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.760
Ooh, I remembered what I was gonna ask.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:26.620
Did you kill him?

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:26.920
No.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.260
you had said yes, I woulda had you!

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.800
So, after you and Robert fought.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.200
Talked.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.000
You left the office, you didn't take your car?

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.600
I went to a bar, in The Scotchman.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.440
I didn't want to drive drunk, so I took a cab.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.400
And you didn't have your phone?

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.240
I left it charging in my office and I didn't realize till I was

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.180
already out of the building.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.600
Oh, man, if I go ten minutes without looking at my phone,

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.420
my pumpkin crop dies on my little farm.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:50.340
This is not the time for stories about your digital squash, Peralta.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:50.680
Fine.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.640
Talking about your phone.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.480
Why does it matter that I forgot it?

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:54.940
Ohhh,

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:59.640
if I had it on me, you could've seen it pinging off the cell tower.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:00.320
It Doesn't matter.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:01.380
It Didn't have it on me.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.300
So you took a cab to this bar.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.380
we talked to the employees of the Scotchman.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.540
Nobody saw you there.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.880
Nobody remembers seeing me.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:08.900
But let me ask you this.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.160
did you kill him?

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:10.440
Nah.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.980
You know, it's not surprising nobody remembers seeing me.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.700
The bar was extremely crowded that night,

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:18.120
and I spent my whole time in the corner talking to this woman, Dana.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:18.820
Oh, so you said.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:20.460
But when we ran all the credit card receipts,

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:23.680
nobody named Dana Why do you even drink that night.

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:26.380
Trust me, Dana wasn't buying her own drinks.

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:26.880
No?

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:30.700
Hold on.
